## Don't spread yourself thin

The usual mistake is opening five channels and abandoning all of them a month later. One channel you actually keep up is worth more. Once it works, add the next one.

## How UXellent handles this

UXellent builds the base for you: a designed website that fits your field, with pages, copy and images, in minutes. Every page is ready for Google and AI search. Clients reach you through a contact form that lands straight in your inbox, or a WhatsApp button in one tap, and every enquiry is saved. If you already have a site, you can import its content. When you want to update something, you write it in the chat or click and edit, with no vendors and no tech skills.

